commit f008006921279313c33560528f79a66cec188702
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:15:35 2026 +0000

    Map the spacer steps 3 to 5 to Tailwind's scale under the layer (unit AS3)
    
    The 17 spacing maps take measure('spacer-3', 1rem), measure('spacer-4',
    1.5rem), and measure('spacer-5', 3rem); the layer's $scale emits each as
    calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * N), so one step digit names one length and
    the infixed and Bootstrap-only names follow a consumer's --spacing. The
    gutters stay literal; ./bootstrap stays byte-identical (332,388 bytes).
    A conformance case reads p-5 against p-md-5, gap-5 against column-gap-5,
    and the px-5 px-lg-4 and p-4 p-md-3 ladders under both sheets; the token
    table gains the three rows; both recipe records regenerated.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017fwYCgxCd9JhL43kVBLBJV

